# Order ids are unique for the session (M4): an acked id is never reused, even after the
# order filled or was cancelled; a rejected order's id stays free.
N 1 1 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 100 5
N 2 2 2 B LMT GTC 0 CN 100 5
# Id 1 filled completely: duplicate.
N 3 1 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 3
# An IOC with nothing to fill is acked, so its id is used.
N 4 3 1 S LMT IOC 0 CN 101 2
N 5 3 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 2
# Rejected for its quantity: id 4 stays free and the next order may take it.
N 6 4 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 0
N 7 4 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 101 2
C 8 4
# Id 4 was cancelled: duplicate.
N 9 4 1 S LMT GTC 0 CN 102 1
